# The headscale coordination server, the self-hosted control plane the router's
# WireGuard mesh registers against. Managed from the console by tui-vpn.
#
# The package comes from the same signed tui-tools repository the tools do
# (https://pkgs.tui.tools/arch/$arch) -- a mirror built FROM SOURCE by
# tui-tools/headscale and re-released under the family's own signature, so the
# provenance chain is ours from commit to package, not a re-signed upstream
# binary. install/server/addons/headscale.preflight.sh configures that
# repository first, and skips the whole install when the machine already has a
# headscale: an existing install, from any source, is the operator's to keep.
headscale
